-<p style="font-size:.92rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:.5rem">This means the first-time homebuyer restriction does not apply.</p>
-<p style="font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7">In Targeted Counties, borrowers simply must not own a home or have any ownership interest in a home at the time their loan is closed. This is a broader eligibility window than Non-Targeted Counties, which require first-time buyer status or no homeownership in the prior 3 years.</p>
-<p style="margin-top:.75rem;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)">Source: South Carolina State Housing Finance and Development Authority</p>
