-<p style="font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem">VA</p>
-<p style="font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">No down payment required. Min credit score: <strong style="color:var(--navy)">640</strong>.</p>
