+low-income families have the opportunity to use Federal housing assistance that would otherwise be paid to a landlord as rent to
+purchase and build equity in a home of their own. This program along with the SC Housing Homebuyer Program provides FHA fixed
+rate financing with forgivable down payment assistance. Please see the SC Housing Homebuyer Program Guide and Manual for
+additional details.
