+              <div class="field__item">      <div id="body-971" class="paragraph paragraph--id--971 paragraph--type--body paragraph--view-mode--default body">
+      <div class="wrap">
+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h2>Why choose a Palmetto Home Advantage mortgage?</h2><img src="/sites/schousing/files/inline-images/09.04.25%20-%20Palmetto%20Home%20Adv%20Logo.png" data-entity-uuid="2346b88b-24bd-4baa-8e3b-675e4d2bf7a6" data-entity-type="file" alt="Palmetto Home Advantage Logo" width="317" height="229" class="align-right" loading="lazy"><p>The Palmetto Home Advantage offers Conventional, FHA, VA and USDA loan options for first-time, move-up and repeat buyers with no first-time home buyer requirements for new and existing homes across all 46 counties in South Carolina. All program options require a minimum 640 credit score, have no sales price limits and follow all applicable insurer guidelines with a borrower income limit of $135,750. This income is not based on total household income and is not dependent on family size. &nbsp;</p><p>The program offers forgivable down payment assistance of 0%, 3%, or 4% of the loan amount with no monthly payment. &nbsp;</p><p>Conventional financing options up to 97% Loan to Value on one-unit properties and up to 95% Loan to Value on two – unit properties with no sales price limits and follows all applicable insurer guidelines for Fannie Mae's HFA Preferred and Freddie Mac's HFA Advantage programs.</p><p>For additional information and to see if you qualify, contact one of our <a href="/homebuyers/find-lender" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="661cedab-2beb-4807-a04d-2b96fdad1947" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Find a Lender"><strong>approved lending partners</strong></a>.</p><h3>For more information:</h3><p>For full details, please read our<a href="https://schousing.sc.gov/sites/schousing/files/Documents/Homebuyers/Palmetto%20Home%20Advantage/PHAHandout%20(12.01.2024).pdf"> </a><a href="https://schousing.sc.gov/sites/schousing/files/Documents/Homebuyers/Marketing%20Fliers/PHAHandout%20(10.01.2025).pdf"><strong>Palmetto Home Advantage Program Handout (PDF</strong>)</a>.</p><h3>Are you a lender interested in the Palmetto Home Advantage program?</h3><p>Please visit Lakeview Loan Servicing's website at <a href="https://www.lakeviewcorrespondent.com/"><strong>www.lakeviewcorrespondent.com</strong></a>, if you’re a lender looking to learn more about how the Palmetto Home Advantage program can help your customers.</p></div>
